Note on bundled third-party material:

`references/official_rewriter_t2i.txt` and `references/official_rewriter_edit.txt`
are the official Qwen-Image 2.1 rewriter system prompts, included unmodified and
used under their own terms from Alibaba / the Qwen team. They are not covered by
the MIT license above.

`references/delivery-and-verification.md` adapts the delivery-side framing of the
`qwen-image-gen` skill from ZSeven-W/craft-skills (MIT, (c) Fini.Yang).
